    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρόσ-κοπος</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not stumbling,
				void of offence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Phil.
				1.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνείδησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					24.16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>free from harm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτρυτος καί ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(2).20.19
				</span></i>
			 (Tegea, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>); [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί] σεδιαφυλάσσουσιν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGiss.</u>
					17.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PBaden</u>
				39 iii 14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πως</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				79iv8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>giving no offence,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιϝί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.195
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				10.32
			</span></i>.</div>
